nd you need to make") (text ((start . "1634.64") (dur . "3.44")) "sure that everything is clean and that") (text ((start . "1636.24") (dur . "3.6")) "you do everything the right way so that") (text ((start . "1638.08") (dur . "3.52")) "you don't cause issues for yourself") (text ((start . "1639.84") (dur . "3.36")) "later on. And here, because the melting") (text ((start . "1641.6") (dur . "4")) "temperature of these solder balls is so") (text ((start . "1643.2") (dur . "3.68")) "low, uh, make sure you wait for a") (text ((start . "1645.6") (dur . "3.36")) "sufficient amount of time before you") (text ((start . "1646.88") (dur . "3.84")) "take the chip out. You'd be surprised") (text ((start . "1648.96") (dur . "3.599")) "how long these solder balls can stay") (text ((start . "1650.72") (dur . "4.24")) "melted, especially on a smaller chip.") (text ((start . "1652.559") (dur . "4.801")) "The way molten solder behaves on a small") (text ((start . "1654.96") (dur . "4")) "thermal mass like this tiny chip here is") (text ((start . "1657.36") (dur . "3.52")) "very very different than how molten") (text ((start . "1658.96") (dur . "3.92")) "solder is going to behave on a PCB. So") (text ((start . "1660.88") (dur . "3.919")) "don't be fooled. Your solder balls can") (text ((start . "1662.88") (dur . "4.32")) "stay molten for a lot longer than you") (text ((start . "1664.799") (dur . "3.921")) "think. Allow it the time to cool off.") (text ((start . "1667.2") (dur . "3.52")) "You'll find I'm going to reference Ace") (text ((start . "1668.72") (dur . "4.64")) "Console Repairs in in this video a lot") (text ((start . "1670.72") (dur . "6.24")) "because this dude is constantly dealing") (text ((start . "1673.36") (dur . "5.6")) "with rebaling. He's doing RSX reballs uh") (text ((start . "1676.96") (dur . "4.48")) "multiple times every day in order to do") (text ((start . "1678.96") (dur . "4.48")) "Frankenstein modifications on PS3s. and") (text ((start . "1681.44") (dur . "4.08")) "I've just learned a lot from watching") (text ((start . "1683.44") (dur . "4")) "him. So, that's why I'm I'm constantly") (text ((start . "1685.52") (dur . "3.6")) "referring to to him. But anyways, one of") (text ((start . "1687.44") (dur . "3.599")) "the things that Ace has has taught me") (text ((start . "1689.12") (dur . "3.84")) "most recently, which I wholeheartedly") (text ((start . "1691.039") (dur . "4.88")) "agree with, is that you shouldn't ever") (text ((start . "1692.96") (dur . "5.68")) "be heating a chip for no reason. You") (text ((start . "1695.919") (dur . "5.36")) "want to only apply heat to chips when") (text ((start . "1698.64") (dur . "4.399")) "you need to apply heat to chips. So,") (text ((start . "1701.279") (dur . "4.161")) "here's a great example of when a lot of") (text ((start . "1703.039") (dur . "4.481")) "people would apply a lot of flux to this") (text ((start . "1705.44") (dur . "3.92")) "chip and refflow all these solder balls") (text ((start . "1707.52") (dur . "3.6")) "to make them all look nice and shiny.") (text ((start . "1709.36") (dur . "3.6")) "There really is no good reason to do") (text ((start . "1711.12") (dur . "4.08")) "that in this scenario because the chip") (text ((start . "1712.96") (dur . "4.079")) "is reballed. Like we are already going") (text ((start . "1715.2") (dur . "4.64")) "to refflow and reapply heat to the chip") (text ((start . "1717.039") (dur . "5.201")) "when we go put it on the on the PCB. So") (text ((start . "1719.84") (dur . "4.079")) "there's not really a good reason to be") (text ((start . "1722.24") (dur . "4.159")) "um flooding this thing with flux and") (text ((start . "1723.919") (dur . "4.721")) "reheating it for no reason. Just for our") (text ((start . "1726.399") (dur . "4.16")) "visual pleasure to see all of the shiny") (text ((start . "1728.64") (dur . "3.68")) "solder balls. The only exception to this") (text ((start . "1730.559") (dur . "3.36")) "I would say is if you obviously have") (text ((start . "1732.32") (dur . "4.239")) "missing solder balls that blew off of") (text ((start . "1733.919") (dur . "3.601")) "the pads when you went to heat the chip.") (text ((start . "1736.559") (dur . "2.641")) "Obviously you're going to have to") (text ((start . "1737.52") (dur . "3.2")) "replace those and reheat those. So, at") (text ((start . "1739.2") (dur . "3.76")) "that point, you can maybe reapply a") (text ((start . "1740.72") (dur . "4")) "little bit of flux. I find it helps to") (text ((start . "1742.96") (dur . "3.52")) "correct, you know, if you have five or") (text ((start . "1744.72") (dur . "3.6")) "so solder balls to to correct in the") (text ((start . "1746.48") (dur . "3.84")) "middle of the chip. It can sometimes be") (text ((start . "1748.32") (dur . "3.92")) "nice to have a little bit of fresh flux") (text ((start . "1750.32") (dur . "3.44")) "on the chip just to allow the solder") (text ((start . "1752.24") (dur . "3.76")) "balls to sort of stick to your tweezers") (text ((start . "1753.76") (dur . "3.84")) "and let the flux work with you. The only") (text ((start . "1756") (dur . "2.96")) "other instance I can think of where it") (text ((start . "1757.6") (dur . "3.04")) "would make sense to actually refflow") (text ((start . "1758.96") (dur . "3.52")) "these solder balls at this point is if") (text ((start . "1760.64") (dur . "3.68")) "you had a bunch that were misaligned.") (text ((start . "1762.48") (dur . "4.88")) "You can actually see one up here on the") (text ((start . "1764.32") (dur . "5.12")) "top left that is not 100% centered to") (text ((start . "1767.36") (dur . "5.84")) "its pad. So, this is what sometimes") (text ((start . "1769.44") (dur . "5.52")) "happens is the solder ball will uh melt") (text ((start . "1773.2") (dur . "4.24")) "enough that it sticks to the pad, but it") (text ((start . "1774.96") (dur . "4.64")) "won't fully center onto the pad. If I") (text ((start . "1777.44") (dur . "4.64")) "have enough of these on the chip or if a") (text ((start . "1779.6") (dur . "4.16")) "lot of them are so far off center that") (text ((start . "1782.08") (dur . "4.079")) "I'm a little bit concerned, I will") (text ((start . "1783.76") (dur . "4.24")) "reapply flux and reheat that in order to") (text ((start . "1786.159") (dur . "3.52")) "make them all sort of, you know, dance") (text ((start . "1788") (dur . "3.6")) "into place. So, I don't have to worry") (text ((start . "1789.679") (dur . "3.921")) "about those causing shorts when we go to") (text ((start . "1791.6") (dur . "4.24")) "put it on the board. In this case, I see") (text ((start . "1793.6") (dur . "3.76")) "zero reason to do that. Even for this") (text ((start . "1795.84") (dur . "3.36")) "particular solder ball here that is not") (text ((start . "1797.36") (dur . "4.48")) "fully centered. It really doesn't have a") (text ((start . "1799.2") (dur . "4.32")) "risk of shorting to neighboring solder") (text ((start . "1801.84") (dur . "3.199")) "balls, I would go ahead and just put") (text ((start . "1803.52") (dur . "4.24")) "this on the board. And there's really no") (text ((start . "1805.039") (dur . "4.64")) "good reason to uh like Ace says, apply") (text ((start . "1807.76") (dur . "4.32")) "unnecessary heat to the chip. And you'd") (text ((start . "1809.679") (dur . "4.401")) "be surprised, heat really does uh kill") (text ((start . "1812.08") (dur . "3.599")) "chips a lot faster than you would think.") (text ((start . "1814.08") (dur . "3.68")) "And we're using pretty high temperatures") (text ((start . "1815.679") (dur . "3.841")) "here when we're doing rework. And we're") (text ((start . "1817.76") (dur . "4.399")) "putting these chips through a lot of") (text ((start . "1819.52") (dur . "4.32")) "thermal stress. So you don't want to be") (text ((start . "1822.159") (dur . "3.281")) "reheating these things over and over and") (text ((start . "1823.84") (dur . "3.6")) "over again. just so you can get your") (text ((start . "1825.44") (dur . "3.359")) "shiny solder balls on your chip. But") (text ((start . "1827.44") (dur . "3.52")) "yeah, if you keep all of that stuff in") (text ((start . "1828.799") (dur . "4.48")) "mind, it's really not that bad. And you") (text ((start . "1830.96") (dur . "4.24")) "can see this chip is perfectly reballed") (text ((start . "1833.279") (dur . "4.241")) "and really did not take a whole lot of") (text ((start . "1835.2") (dur . "4.16")) "effort outside of, you know, making sure") (text ((start . "1837.52") (dur . "3.68")) "we had all of our bases covered. So, all") (text ((start . "1839.36") (dur . "4.48")) "that being said, I can't recommend this") (text ((start . "1841.2") (dur . "4")) "thing enough. Again, like I I don't know") (text ((start . "1843.84") (dur . "3.839")) "why I didn't buy this sooner. I'm going") (text ((start . "1845.2") (dur . "4.479")) "to buy probably two or three of these") (text ((start . "1847.679") (dur . "4.24")) "just to have them on hand unless I can") (text ((start . "1849.679") (dur . "3.841")) "find just the tops of these and that's") (text ((start . "1851.919") (dur . "2.721")) "going to make my life so much easier.") (text ((start . "1853.52") (dur . "2.32")) "But yeah, I appreciate you guys for") (text ((start . "1854.64") (dur . "3.36")) "watching and I will see you in the next") (text ((start . "1855.84") (dur . "2.16")) "video."))